   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved water supply services and improved sanitation, including drainage, in the project towns</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">90% of the 24,000 residents of 4 project towns receive 24-hour piped water supply by 2012. 
Progress/Status: 4 water supply systems completed and 24 hour-piped water being supplied to 28,450 residents in the 4 subproject towns. 
Data Source: Records of provincial nam papas (provincial water supply companies) 

Project records 

Socioeconomic surveys in the project area 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
