    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">80% of the 24,000 residents have access to improved sanitation and benefit from improved drainage by 2012. 
Progress/Status: All of civil works for roads and drainage completed; and sanitation improvement is 100% covered in the project area. 
Data Source: Records of provincial nam papas (provincial water supply companies) 

